#: input/pagecontent/transactions.md:49
msgid "A Trust Network Partcipiant publish keys to the Trust Network Gateway for use by Verification Applications.  Keys may be coded for a variety of uses including following the <a0>certificate governance</a0> according to their <a1>$usage**](ValueSet-KeyUsage.html) and trust [**$domain</a1>"
